#: ../../library/rp2.rst:4
msgid ":mod:`rp2` --- functionality specific to the RP2040"
msgstr ":mod:`rp2` --- funkcionalnost specifična za RP2040"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``rp2`` module contains functions and classes specific to the RP2040, as"
" used in the Raspberry Pi Pico."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``rp2`` sadrži funkcije i klase specifične za RP2040, kakav se koristi"
" u Raspberry Pi Pico."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:12
msgid ""
"See the `RP2040 Python datasheet "
"<https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/raspberry-pi-pico-python-sdk.pdf>`_"
" for more information, and `pico-micropython-examples "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-micropython-examples/tree/master/pio>`_"
" for example code."
msgstr ""
"Više informacija potražite u dokumentu `RP2040 Python datasheet "
"<https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/raspberry-pi-pico-python-"
"sdk.pdf>`_\\ , a primjere koda u `pico-micropython-examples "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-micropython-"
"examples/tree/master/pio>`_\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:20
msgid "PIO related functions"
msgstr "Funkcije vezane uz PIO"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:22
msgid "The ``rp2`` module includes functions for assembling PIO programs."
msgstr "Modul ``rp2`` uključuje funkcije za asembliranje PIO programa."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:24
msgid "For running PIO programs, see :class:`rp2.StateMachine`."
msgstr "Za pokretanje PIO programa pogledajte :class:`rp2.StateMachine`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:28
msgid "Assemble a PIO program."
msgstr "Asemblira PIO program."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:30
msgid ""
"The following parameters control the initial state of the GPIO pins, as one "
"of `PIO.IN_LOW`, `PIO.IN_HIGH`, `PIO.OUT_LOW` or `PIO.OUT_HIGH`. If the "
"program uses more than one pin, provide a tuple, e.g. "
"``out_init=(PIO.OUT_LOW, PIO.OUT_LOW)``."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći parametri upravljaju početnim stanjem GPIO pinova, kao jedan od "
"`PIO.IN_LOW`\\ , `PIO.IN_HIGH`\\ , `PIO.OUT_LOW` ili `PIO.OUT_HIGH`\\ . Ako "
"program koristi više od jednog pina, navedite n-torku, npr. "
"``out_init=(PIO.OUT_LOW, PIO.OUT_LOW)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:35
msgid "*out_init* configures the pins used for ``out()`` instructions."
msgstr ""
"*out_init* konfigurira pinove koji se koriste za ``out()`` instrukcije."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:36
msgid ""
"*set_init* configures the pins used for ``set()`` instructions. There can be"
" at most 5."
msgstr ""
"*set_init* konfigurira pinove koji se koriste za ``set()`` instrukcije. Može"
" ih biti najviše 5."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:38
msgid ""
"*sideset_init* configures the pins used for ``.side()`` modifiers. There can"
" be at most 5."
msgstr ""
"*sideset_init* konfigurira pinove koji se koriste za ``.side()`` "
"modifikatore. Može ih biti najviše 5."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:40
msgid ""
"*side_pindir* when set to ``True`` configures ``.side()`` modifiers to be "
"used for pin directions, instead of pin values (the default, when "
"``False``)."
msgstr ""
"*side_pindir* kada je postavljen na ``True`` konfigurira ``.side()`` "
"modifikatore tako da se koriste za smjerove pinova, umjesto za vrijednosti "
"pinova (zadano, kada je ``False``\\ )."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:43
msgid ""
"The following parameters are used by default, but can be overridden in "
"`StateMachine.init()`:"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći parametri koriste se prema zadanim postavkama, ali se mogu "
"nadjačati u `StateMachine.init()`\\ :"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:46
msgid ""
"*in_shiftdir* is the default direction the ISR will shift, either "
"`PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` or `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`."
msgstr ""
"*in_shiftdir* je zadani smjer u kojem će ISR posmicati, ili `PIO.SHIFT_LEFT`"
" ili `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:48
msgid ""
"*out_shiftdir* is the default direction the OSR will shift, either "
"`PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` or `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`."
msgstr ""
"*out_shiftdir* je zadani smjer u kojem će OSR posmicati, ili "
"`PIO.SHIFT_LEFT` ili `PIO.SHIFT_RIGHT`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:50
msgid ""
"*push_thresh* is the threshold in bits before auto-push or conditional re-"
"pushing is triggered."
msgstr ""
"*push_thresh* je prag u bitovima prije nego se aktivira automatsko guranje "
"(auto-push) ili uvjetno ponovno guranje."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:52
msgid ""
"*pull_thresh* is the threshold in bits before auto-pull or conditional re-"
"pulling is triggered."
msgstr ""
"*pull_thresh* je prag u bitovima prije nego se aktivira automatsko "
"povlačenje (auto-pull) ili uvjetno ponovno povlačenje."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:55
msgid "The remaining parameters are:"
msgstr "Preostali parametri su:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:57
msgid "*autopush* configures whether auto-push is enabled."
msgstr ""
"*autopush* konfigurira je li automatsko guranje (auto-push) omogućeno."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:58
msgid "*autopull* configures whether auto-pull is enabled."
msgstr ""
"*autopull* konfigurira je li automatsko povlačenje (auto-pull) omogućeno."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:59
msgid ""
"*fifo_join* configures whether the 4-word TX and RX FIFOs should be combined"
" into a single 8-word FIFO for one direction only. The options are "
"`PIO.JOIN_NONE`, `PIO.JOIN_RX` and `PIO.JOIN_TX`."
msgstr ""
"*fifo_join* konfigurira trebaju li se 4-riječni TX i RX FIFO-ovi spojiti u "
"jedan 8-riječni FIFO samo za jedan smjer. Opcije su `PIO.JOIN_NONE`\\ , "
"`PIO.JOIN_RX` i `PIO.JOIN_TX`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:65
msgid ""
"Assemble a single PIO instruction. You usually want to use `asm_pio()` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Asemblira jednu PIO instrukciju. Obično je umjesto toga bolje koristiti "
"`asm_pio()`\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:73
msgid ""
"Temporarily turns the QSPI_SS pin into an input and reads its value, "
"returning 1 for low and 0 for high. On a typical RP2040 board with a BOOTSEL"
" button, a return value of 1 indicates that the button is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Privremeno pretvara QSPI_SS pin u ulaz i čita njegovu vrijednost, vraćajući "
"1 za nisku i 0 za visoku razinu. Na tipičnoj RP2040 ploči s BOOTSEL gumbom, "
"povratna vrijednost 1 označava da je gumb pritisnut."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:78
msgid ""
"Since this function temporarily disables access to the external flash "
"memory, it also temporarily disables interrupts and the other core to "
"prevent them from trying to execute code from flash."
msgstr ""
"Budući da ova funkcija privremeno onemogućuje pristup vanjskoj flash "
"memoriji, također privremeno onemogućuje prekide i drugu jezgru kako bi ih "
"spriječila da pokušaju izvršavati kod iz flash memorije."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:84
msgid ""
"This exception is raised from `asm_pio()` or `asm_pio_encode()` if there is "
"an error assembling a PIO program."
msgstr ""
"Ova se iznimka podiže iz `asm_pio()` ili `asm_pio_encode()` ako dođe do "
"pogreške pri asembliranju PIO programa."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:89
msgid "PIO assembly language instructions"
msgstr "Instrukcije PIO asemblerskog jezika"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:91
msgid ""
"PIO state machines are programmed in a custom assembly language with nine "
"core PIO-machine instructions.  In MicroPython, PIO assembly routines are "
"written as a Python function with the decorator ``@rp2.asm_pio()``, and they"
" use Python syntax.  Such routines support standard Python variables and "
"arithmetic, as well as the following custom functions that encode PIO "
"instructions and direct the assembler.  See sec 3.4 of the RP2040 datasheet "
"for further details."
msgstr ""
"PIO stroja stanja programiraju se prilagođenim asemblerskim jezikom s devet "
"osnovnih PIO instrukcija.  U MicroPythonu, PIO asemblerske rutine pišu se "
"kao Python funkcija s dekoratorom ``@rp2.asm_pio()`` i koriste Python "
"sintaksu.  Takve rutine podržavaju standardne Python varijable i aritmetiku,"
" kao i sljedeće prilagođene funkcije koje kodiraju PIO instrukcije i "
"upravljaju asemblerom.  Za dodatne pojedinosti pogledajte odjeljak 3.4 "
"RP2040 datasheeta."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:98
msgid "wrap_target()"
msgstr "wrap_target()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:99
msgid ""
"Specify the location where execution continues after program wrapping. By "
"default this is the start of the PIO routine."
msgstr ""
"Određuje lokaciju na kojoj se izvršavanje nastavlja nakon omatanja programa."
" Prema zadanim postavkama to je početak PIO rutine."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:102
msgid "wrap()"
msgstr "wrap()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:103
msgid ""
"Specify the location where the program finishes and wraps around. If this "
"directive is not used then it is added automatically at the end of the PIO "
"routine.  Wrapping does not cost any execution cycles."
msgstr ""
"Određuje lokaciju na kojoj program završava i omata se. Ako se ova direktiva"
" ne koristi, automatski se dodaje na kraju PIO rutine.  Omatanje ne troši "
"nijedan ciklus izvršavanja."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:107
msgid "label(label)"
msgstr "label(label)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:108
msgid ""
"Define a label called *label* at the current location.  *label* can be a "
"string or integer."
msgstr ""
"Definira oznaku pod imenom *label* na trenutnoj lokaciji.  *label* može biti"
" string ili cijeli broj."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:111
msgid "word(instr, label=None)"
msgstr "word(instr, label=None)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:112
msgid "Insert an arbitrary 16-bit word in the assembled output."
msgstr "Umeće proizvoljnu 16-bitnu riječ u asemblirani izlaz."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:114
msgid "*instr*: the 16-bit value"
msgstr "*instr*\\ : 16-bitna vrijednost"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:115
msgid ""
"*label*: if given, look up the label and logical-or the label's value with "
"*instr*"
msgstr ""
"*label*\\ : ako je navedeno, traži oznaku i logički-ili (OR) vrijednost "
"oznake s *instr*"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:118
msgid "jmp(...)"
msgstr "jmp(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:119
msgid "This instruction takes two forms:"
msgstr "Ova instrukcija ima dva oblika:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:121
msgid "jmp(label)"
msgstr "jmp(label)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:122
msgid "*label*: label to jump to unconditionally"
msgstr "*label*\\ : oznaka na koju se bezuvjetno skače"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:124
msgid "jmp(cond, label)"
msgstr "jmp(cond, label)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:125
msgid "*cond*: the condition to check, one of:"
msgstr "*cond*\\ : uvjet za provjeru, jedan od:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:127
msgid "``not_x``, ``not_y``: true if register is zero"
msgstr "``not_x``\\ , ``not_y``\\ : istinito ako je registar nula"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:128
msgid ""
"``x_dec``, ``y_dec``: true if register is non-zero, and do post decrement"
msgstr ""
"``x_dec``\\ , ``y_dec``\\ : istinito ako je registar različit od nule, te "
"izvodi naknadno dekrementiranje"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:130
msgid "``x_not_y``: true if X is not equal to Y"
msgstr "``x_not_y``\\ : istinito ako X nije jednak Y"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:131
msgid "``pin``: true if the input pin is set"
msgstr "``pin``\\ : istinito ako je ulazni pin postavljen"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:132
msgid "``not_osre``: true if OSR is not empty (hasn't reached its threshold)"
msgstr "``not_osre``\\ : istinito ako OSR nije prazan (nije dosegnuo svoj prag)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:135
msgid "*label*: label to jump to if condition is true"
msgstr "*label*\\ : oznaka na koju se skače ako je uvjet istinit"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:137
msgid "wait(polarity, src, index)"
msgstr "wait(polarity, src, index)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:138
msgid "Block, waiting for high/low on a pin or IRQ line."
msgstr "Blokira, čekajući visoku/nisku razinu na pinu ili IRQ liniji."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:140
msgid "*polarity*: 0 or 1, whether to wait for a low or high value"
msgstr "*polarity*\\ : 0 ili 1, treba li čekati nisku ili visoku vrijednost"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:141
msgid ""
"*src*: one of: ``gpio`` (absolute pin), ``pin`` (pin relative to "
"StateMachine's ``in_base`` argument), ``irq``"
msgstr ""
"*src*\\ : jedan od: ``gpio`` (apsolutni pin), ``pin`` (pin relativan na "
"``in_base`` argument StateMachinea), ``irq``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:143
msgid "*index*: 0-31, the index for *src*"
msgstr "*index*\\ : 0-31, indeks za *src*"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:145
msgid "in_(src, bit_count)"
msgstr "in_(src, bit_count)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:146
msgid "Shift data in from *src* to ISR."
msgstr "Posmiče podatke iz *src* u ISR."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:148
msgid "*src*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``null``, ``isr``, ``osr``"
msgstr ""
"*src*\\ : jedan od: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``null``\\ , ``isr``\\ "
", ``osr``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:149
msgid "*bit_count*: number of bits to shift in (1-32)"
msgstr "*bit_count*\\ : broj bitova za posmicanje unutra (1-32)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:151
msgid "out(dest, bit_count)"
msgstr "out(dest, bit_count)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:152
msgid "Shift data out from OSR to *dest*."
msgstr "Posmiče podatke iz OSR u *dest*\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:154
msgid ""
"*dest*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``pindirs``, ``pc``, ``isr``, "
"``exec``"
msgstr ""
"*dest*\\ : jedan od: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``pindirs``\\ , "
"``pc``\\ , ``isr``\\ , ``exec``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:156
msgid "*bit_count*: number of bits to shift out (1-32)"
msgstr "*bit_count*\\ : broj bitova za posmicanje van (1-32)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:158
msgid "push(...)"
msgstr "push(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:159
msgid ""
"Push ISR to the RX FIFO, then clear ISR to zero. This instruction takes the "
"following forms:"
msgstr ""
"Gura ISR u RX FIFO, zatim postavlja ISR na nulu. Ova instrukcija ima "
"sljedeće oblike:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:162
msgid "push()"
msgstr "push()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:163
msgid "push(block)"
msgstr "push(block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:164
msgid "push(noblock)"
msgstr "push(noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:165
msgid "push(iffull)"
msgstr "push(iffull)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:166
msgid "push(iffull, block)"
msgstr "push(iffull, block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:167
msgid "push(iffull, noblock)"
msgstr "push(iffull, noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:169
msgid ""
"If ``block`` is used then the instruction stalls if the RX FIFO is full. The"
" default is to block.  If ``iffull`` is used then it only pushes if the "
"input shift count has reached its threshold."
msgstr ""
"Ako se koristi ``block``\\ , instrukcija zastaje ako je RX FIFO pun. Zadano "
"je blokiranje.  Ako se koristi ``iffull``\\ , gura samo ako je broj "
"posmaknutih ulaznih bitova dosegnuo svoj prag."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:173
msgid "pull(...)"
msgstr "pull(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:174
msgid ""
"Pull from the TX FIFO into OSR. This instruction takes the following forms:"
msgstr "Povlači iz TX FIFO-a u OSR. Ova instrukcija ima sljedeće oblike:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:177
msgid "pull()"
msgstr "pull()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:178
msgid "pull(block)"
msgstr "pull(block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:179
msgid "pull(noblock)"
msgstr "pull(noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:180
msgid "pull(ifempty)"
msgstr "pull(ifempty)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:181
msgid "pull(ifempty, block)"
msgstr "pull(ifempty, block)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:182
msgid "pull(ifempty, noblock)"
msgstr "pull(ifempty, noblock)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:184
msgid ""
"If ``block`` is used then the instruction stalls if the TX FIFO is empty. "
"The default is to block.  If ``ifempty`` is used then it only pulls if the "
"output shift count has reached its threshold."
msgstr ""
"Ako se koristi ``block``\\ , instrukcija zastaje ako je TX FIFO prazan. "
"Zadano je blokiranje.  Ako se koristi ``ifempty``\\ , povlači samo ako je "
"broj posmaknutih izlaznih bitova dosegnuo svoj prag."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:188
msgid "mov(dest, src)"
msgstr "mov(dest, src)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:189
msgid "Move into *dest* the value from *src*."
msgstr "Premješta u *dest* vrijednost iz *src*\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:191
msgid ""
"*dest*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``exec``, ``pc``, ``isr``, ``osr``"
msgstr ""
"*dest*\\ : jedan od: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``exec``\\ , ``pc``\\ "
", ``isr``\\ , ``osr``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:192
msgid ""
"*src*: one of: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``null``, ``status``, ``isr``, "
"``osr``; this argument can be optionally modified by wrapping it in "
"``invert()`` or ``reverse()`` (but not both together)"
msgstr ""
"*src*\\ : jedan od: ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``null``\\ , "
"``status``\\ , ``isr``\\ , ``osr``\\ ; ovaj argument se može opcionalno "
"modificirati omatanjem u ``invert()`` ili ``reverse()`` (ali ne oboje "
"zajedno)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:196
msgid "irq(...)"
msgstr "irq(...)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:197
msgid "Set or clear an IRQ flag. This instruction takes two forms:"
msgstr "Postavlja ili briše IRQ zastavicu. Ova instrukcija ima dva oblika:"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:200
msgid "irq(index)"
msgstr "irq(index)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:201 ../../library/rp2.rst:205
msgid "*index*: 0-7, or ``rel(0)`` to ``rel(7)``"
msgstr "*index*\\ : 0-7, ili ``rel(0)`` do ``rel(7)``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:203
msgid "irq(mode, index)"
msgstr "irq(mode, index)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:204
msgid "*mode*: one of: ``block``, ``clear``"
msgstr "*mode*\\ : jedan od: ``block``\\ , ``clear``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:207
msgid ""
"If ``block`` is used then the instruction stalls until the flag is cleared "
"by another entity.  If ``clear`` is used then the flag is cleared instead of"
" being set.  Relative IRQ indices add the state machine ID to the IRQ index "
"with modulo-4 addition.  IRQs 0-3 are visible from to the processor, 4-7 are"
" internal to the state machines."
msgstr ""
"Ako se koristi ``block``\\ , instrukcija zastaje sve dok drugi entitet ne "
"obriše zastavicu.  Ako se koristi ``clear``\\ , zastavica se briše umjesto "
"da se postavlja.  Relativni IRQ indeksi dodaju ID stroja stanja IRQ indeksu "
"pomoću zbrajanja modulo-4.  IRQ-ovi 0-3 vidljivi su procesoru, dok su 4-7 "
"interni za strojeve stanja."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:213
msgid "set(dest, data)"
msgstr "set(dest, data)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:214
msgid "Set *dest* with the value *data*."
msgstr "Postavlja *dest* na vrijednost *data*\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:216
msgid "*dest*: ``pins``, ``x``, ``y``, ``pindirs``"
msgstr "*dest*\\ : ``pins``\\ , ``x``\\ , ``y``\\ , ``pindirs``"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:217
msgid "*data*: value (0-31)"
msgstr "*data*\\ : vrijednost (0-31)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:219
msgid "nop()"
msgstr "nop()"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:220
msgid ""
"This is a pseudoinstruction that assembles to ``mov(y, y)`` and has no side "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je pseudoinstrukcija koja se asemblira u ``mov(y, y)`` i nema nuspojava."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:223
msgid ".side(value)"
msgstr ".side(value)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:224
msgid ""
"This is a modifier which can be applied to any instruction, and is used to "
"control side-set pin values."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je modifikator koji se može primijeniti na bilo koju instrukciju, a "
"koristi se za upravljanje vrijednostima side-set pinova."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:227
msgid "*value*: the value (bits) to output on the side-set pins"
msgstr "*value*\\ : vrijednost (bitovi) za izlaz na side-set pinovima"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:229
msgid ".delay(value)"
msgstr ".delay(value)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:230
msgid ""
"This is a modifier which can be applied to any instruction, and specifies "
"how many cycles to delay for after the instruction executes."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je modifikator koji se može primijeniti na bilo koju instrukciju, a "
"određuje koliko ciklusa treba odgoditi nakon izvršavanja instrukcije."

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:233
msgid ""
"*value*: cycles to delay, 0-31 (maximum value reduced if side-set pins are "
"used)"
msgstr ""
"*value*\\ : ciklusi za odgodu, 0-31 (maksimalna vrijednost se smanjuje ako "
"se koriste side-set pinovi)"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:236
msgid "[value]"
msgstr "[value]"

#: ../../library/rp2.rst:237
